{"unit_id":"cilis__dsh-tauri-launcher#feature-1","repo":"cilis/dsh-tauri-launcher","commit":"2d2083c572f3d233646310b0385f1b4b14211570","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Tauri Launcher 的功能「桌面启停控制」：在 DSH Web 的「桌面启动」设置分区查看运行状态并启动或退出 Tauri 桌面应用；退出操作提供确认，状态和失败诊断会显示在面板中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:273-300","lib/index.js:676-707"]}
